<title>UK: BP shares firm after third quarter results.</title>
<headline>BP shares firm after third quarter results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Petroleum Co Plc rose on Tuesday after the oil giant posted a sharp rise in third quarter profits.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5-1/2p at 644 by 1135 GMT, after being up just 1/2p shortly before the release.</p>
<p>Third-quarter net replacement profits rose to 650 million stg from 532 million a year earlier, compared with analyst expectations mostly in a range between 600 million stg and 675 million.</p>
</text>
